{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tSNWay5sDx9Hd0-ExhUngw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:47.553378+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tSNWay5sDx9Hd0-ExhUngw","html":"<div><section><section><span><br/></span><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为做好学部推免生接收工作，更好地服务考生，帮助考生与导师间搭建沟通桥梁，西安电子科技大学信息交叉学部（以下简称“学部”）现启动推免生预报名工作。</span></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>招生类型</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>学部招收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生（简称：“推免生”）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>基本要求</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.中华人民共和国公民。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span>3.身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span>4.获得本科就读高校推免生资格。</span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span>5.无任何学术不端行为记录，无任何不良诚信或违法、违纪行为记录。</span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span>注：预报名阶段，对于尚未确定但仍有希望获得推荐免试资格的考生可同样进行申请，正式报名阶段未取得推免生资格的，预报名自动无效。</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>3</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>招生专业</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>学科/专业领域：数学</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>学科/专业领域方向：数学与智能信息技术</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>4</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>预报名</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.即日起，考生可登录西安电子科技大学研究生招生服务平台推免生预报名系统（https://yjspt.xidian.edu.cn/gsapp/sys/wdyjsbm/entrance.do）在“2027年推免生预报名”模块选择信息交叉学部，按照报名要求填写相关信息。（导师信息可通过信息交叉学部数学与交叉科学研究院主页获取，https://imis.xidian.edu.cn/szdw/bssds.htm）</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>学部研究生报名平台截止报名时间为9月21日18:00。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>2.预报名考生须在系统上提交以下材料：</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>（1）个人简历一份；</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>（2）本人身份证和学生证复印件各一份；</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>（3）成绩排名证明（须加盖学校教务部门公章或所在学院公章）；</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>（4）截至目前本科阶段成绩单一份（须加盖学校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>（5）国家英语四、六级考试成绩单或TOEFL、GRE/GMAT等体现自身英语水平的证明一份；</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>（6）其他相关证明材料（如竞赛获奖证书，已发表或已录用的、能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等）；</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>（7）《西安电子科技大学推免生报考诚信承诺书》（附件1），（本人手写签名后扫描上传）。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>5</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>正式报名</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>教育部“推免服务系统”开通后，所有通过西电研究生报名平台报名且通过考核的推免生，必须在教育部“推免服务系统”进行网报。报考单位与专业应与预报名系统中最终信息一致。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>复试考核</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>考生在推免生预报名系统提交材料且导师审核通过后方可进行复试考核。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>1.坚持德智体美劳全面衡量，将考生思想政治素质和品德作为推免生录取的重要依据，思想政治素质和品德考核不合格者不予录取。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>2.复试考核既考察考生既往学业表现，同时加强科研创新潜质和专业素质能力的考核。考核内容一般包括英语口语与听力、专业知识与知识结构、科研能力与创新意识、综合素质等。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>3.复试考核形式以综合面试为主，综合面试时间一般不少于20分钟，并填写复试情况记录表。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>录取</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.推免生接收预报名工作通过西安电子科技大学研究生招生服务平台进行，考生仅选择一个单位进行预报名。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>2.推免生接收录取工作通过推免服务系统进行，按照系统时间节点完成工作流程，考生同意待录取后，我校一律不再取消。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>8</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>咨询方式</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>咨询电话：029-81892653，029-88202705</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>研招邮箱：inforx@xidian.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>联系人：朱老师 吴老师</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>点击阅读原文以下载附件</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>信息交叉学部</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2026年9月9日</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>END</span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/azwqo8iaKOEic9R8t3mhbGTbMrmsW7tqdQEAllcibwXKmIlibQVSrWWG66tsPCVBicV95Mhn2nxVyXujtZRsmkNe1SMaZATeMxRvhcXkjDxGdcQw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>关注我们</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>微 信 号：135editor</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>新浪微博：@135编辑器</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><span alt=\"\" title=\"\"><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"44ecfb6bb1f14bc2392b33d2fb65f680328ac7a998c8b82baf79187722a4988b","textLength":1347,"sourceSha256":"15d4abea81d2ed0b4d7ea030adede7ea80f7a6494b4d11132060f3af48664a7e","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-cf07b4a72d1271b9e939","title":"2026年西安电子科技大学信息交叉学部2027年推荐免试研究生招生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:47.553378+00:00"}
